# Pin JSON files to LF so the i18n locale files stop drifting between
# CRLF (legacy Windows checkout) and LF (Linux/CI tooling). This is the
# fix for semantic-review v1, issue #2 — every translation.json had 64
# CRLF lines mixed with 14 LF lines, which produced noisy diffs whenever
# any editor renormalized them. Scope is intentionally narrow: only JSON
# is touched here, the rest of the tree's existing line endings are left
# alone to avoid sweeping renormalization on this branch.
*.json text eol=lf
